WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.970
A car drives along at a steady speed.

2
00:00:03.020 --> 00:00:06.710
The brakes are brand new,
and the tyres are perfect.

3
00:00:06.760 --> 00:00:09.970
Then the driver glances down
at a phone, just for a moment,

4
00:00:10.020 --> 00:00:12.190
as a child steps out ahead.

5
00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:15.150
The car takes longer to
stop than it would have.

6
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:16.930
Nothing is wrong with the car.

7
00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:19.290
So why does it travel further?

8
00:00:19.340 --> 00:00:23.450
In this mission, you'll split
stopping distance into two parts:

9
00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:25.720
thinking distance
and braking distance.

10
00:00:25.770 --> 00:00:28.490
You'll find out what affects each one,

11
00:00:28.540 --> 00:00:33.430
from tiredness and alcohol to
speed and a wet or icy road.

12
00:00:33.480 --> 00:00:37.070
Your mission: find out why the
distracted driver needs further

13
00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:38.410
to stop.
